<GuideLayout
  title="Mushroom Coffee: Is It Worth It?"
  description="An honest look at mushroom coffee and functional coffee trends. What's in it, does it work, what the science says, and whether you should try it."
  headline="Mushroom Coffee: <em>Is It Worth It?</em>"
  subtitle="It's one of the fastest-growing trends in coffee. But is mushroom coffee actually better for you, or is it just marketing? Here's an honest breakdown."
